<HelpTab>
    <FluentText>
        Announcements are short notices for staff at a location, such as a change to opening times or a reminder
        about a staff meeting. Staff see them in the Announcements widget on their home screen or a dashboard.
    </FluentText>

    <HelpSection Title="Posting an announcement">
        <ol>
            <li>On <a href="/manage/announcements">Announcements</a>, select <strong>New Announcement</strong>.</li>
            <li>Write a <strong>Title</strong> and the <strong>Body</strong>.</li>
            <li>Admins choose the <strong>Location</strong>. Everyone else posts to their own location.</li>
            <li>Optionally set <strong>Expires on</strong>. The announcement stays up until the end of that day.</li>
            <li>Turn on <strong>Pin to the top of the widget</strong> for anything important.</li>
            <li>Leave <strong>Email it to staff at this location</strong> on to email everyone there, then select
                <strong>Save</strong>.</li>
        </ol>
        <FluentText>
            Staff who have turned on phone notifications also get a push notification. Anyone who has turned
            announcement emails off in their notification settings isn't emailed.
        </FluentText>
    </HelpSection>

    <HelpSection Title="Managing announcements">
        <ul>
            <li>The list shows pinned announcements first, then newest. <strong>Status</strong> is <strong>Live</strong>,
                <strong>Until</strong> a date, or <strong>Expired</strong>.</li>
            <li><strong>Edit</strong> to change one. Turn on <strong>Email it to staff again</strong> if the change needs
                sending out.</li>
            <li><strong>Delete</strong> to take it down.</li>
            <li>Admins can turn on <strong>Show all locations</strong> to see every location's announcements.</li>
        </ul>
        <FluentText>
            Announcements can't be scheduled to start later, only to expire. Posting needs the Admin or
            CanPostAnnouncements role.
        </FluentText>
    </HelpSection>
</HelpTab>
